                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "For each attribute there are four levels, ranging from mediocre to great. The highest level improves that attribute by a large amount, and is thus highly desirable. What education trait a character gets is semi-random, but usually in the same area as their guardian, and often at the same level as well."
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "The determination of the trait a child receives is hardcoded and not directly visible. Experimentation has shown that it only depends on the education trait of the guardian, which is therefore generally considered a very important factor when choosing a guardian:"
                },
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "guardian skills, personality traits or opinion have no influence",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "the length of time the guardian has educated the child has no impact",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "education traits from all attributes behave in the same way.",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "The probability of getting:"
                },
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "the same rank trait as the guardian is roughly 50%",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "a rank one step away from the guardians rank is roughly 15-30%",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "a rank two steps away from the guardians rank is roughly 5%-10%",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "a rank three steps away from the guardians rank is roughly 8%",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                },
